    "description": {
      "content": "The ACTIVE Network Activity Search API v2 returns publicly searchable activities and events (races, camps, classes, tournaments, and other registerable assets) from ACTIVE.com and ACTIVEkids.com. All endpoints are read-only, return public data, and are authenticated with an API key passed as the api_key query parameter. Generated by the API Evangelist enrichment pipeline from ACTIVE Network's published developer documentation; not an official ACTIVE Network artifact.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: ACTIVE Network Developer Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
